   }
  ]
 },
 "hints": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": [
   "A new house touches at most the run ending just left of it or the run starting just right of it; the build rule forbids touching both, so runs never merge.",
   "Store run lengths at both endpoints of every run; interior points never need updating.",
   "The longest run never shrinks, so keep a running maximum."
  ],
